    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92162" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾰν-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαίνω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drop</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτρην κοιλαίνει ῥ. ὕδατος
					ἐνδελεχείῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Choeril.
					10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Acus.
				4
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγραὶ ῥ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				106
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρόσου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					227
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Wi.</u>
				11.22
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. βέβληκέ με</span> a
				rain-<i>drop</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				171
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				349b31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				374a9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>semen virile,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				10.45
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Pall.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>drop, spot</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πτίλα ἔχει ῥανίδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					17.23
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				38
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ τοῦ χρυσοῦ ῥ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				3.48
			</span></i>.</div>
